# P0 Fixes Walkthrough

## Changes Made

### P0-1: `active_bots` wiring (Digest callback fix)

| File | Change |
|------|--------|
| [discord_bot.py](file:///e:/TDC_App/TDGAMES_App/Sync_Qdrant/bots/discord_bot.py) | Added `active_bots` param, self-register on [on_ready()](file:///e:/TDC_App/TDGAMES_App/Sync_Qdrant/bots/discord_bot.py#67-74) |
| [slack_bot.py](file:///e:/TDC_App/TDGAMES_App/Sync_Qdrant/bots/slack_bot.py) | Added `active_bots` param, register during [__init__()](file:///e:/TDC_App/TDGAMES_App/Sync_Qdrant/core/scheduled_digest.py#44-72) |
| [main.py](file:///e:/TDC_App/TDGAMES_App/Sync_Qdrant/main.py) | Pass `active_bots` to [run_discord_bot()](file:///e:/TDC_App/TDGAMES_App/Sync_Qdrant/bots/discord_bot.py#506-544) and [run_slack_bot()](file:///e:/TDC_App/TDGAMES_App/Sync_Qdrant/bots/slack_bot.py#583-634) |

**Before:** `active_bots = {}` — never populated → [digest_send_callback](file:///e:/TDC_App/TDGAMES_App/Sync_Qdrant/main.py#216-243) always failed silently  
**After:** Bots self-register → `active_bots["discord"]["TD_CTO"] = bot_instance`

