### P0-2: LLM retry with tenacity

| File | Change |
|------|--------|
| [llm_utils.py](file:///e:/TDC_App/TDGAMES_App/Sync_Qdrant/core/llm_utils.py) | **[NEW]** Shared retry decorators (3 attempts, exponential backoff) |
| [intent_detector.py](file:///e:/TDC_App/TDGAMES_App/Sync_Qdrant/core/intent_detector.py) | Wrapped [detect()](file:///e:/TDC_App/TDGAMES_App/Sync_Qdrant/core/intent_detector.py#94-150) LLM call |
| [query_engine.py](file:///e:/TDC_App/TDGAMES_App/Sync_Qdrant/core/query_engine.py) | Wrapped [answer()](file:///e:/TDC_App/TDGAMES_App/Sync_Qdrant/core/query_engine.py#45-106) LLM call + DRY refactor |
| [daily_digest.py](file:///e:/TDC_App/TDGAMES_App/Sync_Qdrant/core/daily_digest.py) | Wrapped [_summarize_batch()](file:///e:/TDC_App/TDGAMES_App/Sync_Qdrant/core/daily_digest.py#186-250) LLM call |
| [scheduled_digest.py](file:///e:/TDC_App/TDGAMES_App/Sync_Qdrant/core/scheduled_digest.py) | Wrapped [_summarize_messages()](file:///e:/TDC_App/TDGAMES_App/Sync_Qdrant/core/scheduled_digest.py#372-420) LLM call |
| [conversation_manager.py](file:///e:/TDC_App/TDGAMES_App/Sync_Qdrant/core/conversation_manager.py) | Wrapped [parse_date_with_llm()](file:///e:/TDC_App/TDGAMES_App/Sync_Qdrant/core/conversation_manager.py#338-366) LLM call |
| [requirements.txt](file:///e:/TDC_App/TDGAMES_App/Sync_Qdrant/requirements.txt) | Added `tenacity>=8.0` |

**Retries on:** `APITimeoutError`, `APIConnectionError`, `RateLimitError`, `InternalServerError`  
**Strategy:** 3 attempts, wait 2s → 4s → 15s max

